  "title": "· In View | Hermès Hong Kong Presents the Hermèstories Fantastical Theater and Exhibition: Step Inside the Hermès Stage of Whimsy ·",
  "original_title": "视野 | Hermès 爱马仕香港呈现 Hermèstories 奇幻剧场及展览：走进爱马仕奇思妙想的舞台",
  "excerpt": "Hermès will present “Hermèstories,” a theatrical exhibition on its family history and signature creations, in Hong Kong from October 24 to November 8, 2026.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-28",
